    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Why let death stop the party? You were a pretty college kid who liked running with the wrong crowd, and you're really running with the wrong crowd now &mdash; and you really like it. All you have to do is suck up to the elders and enjoy yourself, and everything will be just fine. That's what you keep telling yourself, anyway.</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Nature:</strong> Celebrant<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Conformist</p><p><strong>Physical:</strong> Lithe x3, Nimble x2, Quick x3, Docile (N)<br><strong>Social:</strong> Expressive x3, Gorgeous, Ingratiating x3, Persuasive x3<br><strong>Mental:</strong> Clever x3, Creative x3, Observant x3</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Dodge 2, Performance 1, Subterfuge 1</p><p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Auspex: Heightened Senses, Aura Perception; Presence: Awe</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Herd 1, Influence: High Society 1, Resources 1 (@UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.rules-reference.JournalEntry.St7uVm2DqK4nRy8X]{Status}: Acknowledged)<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> (5, 2, 1)<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 4<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 3</p>",
